1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
Listen to an announcement in a classroom.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:12,010
Students, I'd like to invite you to participate in a unique optional assignment.

3
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:18,090
We'll be conducting a field study at the local nature reserve next Friday,

4
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:22,300
observing frogs and sampling water conditions to see

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:26,040
if water pollution has an impact on frog behavior.

6
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:33,140
This is an excellent opportunity to apply what we've learned in class to a real world environment.

7
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:38,140
It's free to participate, but we can only have 30 students

8
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:42,000
so don't wait to sign up.
